     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 3 Outcome 1 
Implementation Period: Jul 01, 2022 - Jun 30, 2024</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy 3: Climate and disaster resilience enhanced.
Outcome 1: To improve community resilience to climate change and disasters, reforms in the third area in subprogram 1 will include new national policies to further guide and enhance investments in the energy, water, and sanitation sectors and improve access to affordable, reliable, sustainable services, addressing the impact of climate change; as well as comprehensive frameworks to guide preparedness and response to disasters and disaster risks. Other measures will improve the targeting, operational efficiency, and disaster-responsiveness of the social protection system to provide well-targeted transfers after disasters.</narrative>
